### 1. Crear Detalle de Pedido (Solo Admin / Lógica interna)
POST {{baseUrl}}/order-details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderId": 7,
    "productId": 60,
    "quantity": 1
}


### 2. Obtener Todos los Detalles de Pedidos (Solo Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/order-details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 3. Obtener un Detalle por ID (Funciona con token de CLIENTE o ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/order-details/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Actualizar Cantidad del Detalle (Solo Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/order-details/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "quantity": 6
}


### 5. Eliminar Detalle (Solo Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/order-details/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}